  = help: usage: `import(path, delim: Str, header: Bool = true, skip: Int = 0, na_values: List, types: Record, names: keep | snake = keep)`

error[Z0404]: `import` takes no definitions; `path = ...` defines a column
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:8
  |
1 | import(path = "d.csv")
  |        ^^^^ `=` defines, `:` sets an option
  |
  = help: write `path: ...` for an option; usage: `import(path, delim: Str, header: Bool = true, skip: Int = 0, na_values: List, types: Record, names: keep | snake = keep)`
